# NaturalWrite environment
#
# The app builds and runs with none of these set. Missing values are reported in
# the UI rather than worked around.

# --- AI provider (server-side only, never exposed to the browser) -----------
# Without this, generation routes return 503 and the studio says so.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
# Optional: pin a model. Defaults to gpt-4.1-mini.
OPENAI_MODEL=
# Optional: point at an OpenAI-compatible gateway.
OPENAI_BASE_URL=

# Optional: JSON price table used to estimate cost on the usage page.
# Models absent from this table report cost as "not configured" instead of a
# guessed number. Values are USD per one million tokens.
# MODEL_PRICING_JSON={"gpt-4.1-mini":{"input":0.4,"output":1.6}}

# --- Research search provider (server-side only) ----------------------------
# The research assistant needs one of these to retrieve real sources. Without
# one, the research page disables search and says so. It will never invent
# sources, quotations or findings to fill the gap.
# Tavily is used when both are set.
TAVILY_API_KEY=
BRAVE_SEARCH_API_KEY=
# Optional: point a provider at a proxy or a self-hosted gateway.
TAVILY_BASE_URL=
BRAVE_SEARCH_BASE_URL=

# --- Database (Phase 3) -----------------------------------------------------
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
